# The pipeline’s scratch files, its record of the photos this folder has had
# (seen.json: a clone without them must not take them for deleted), and in
# bucket mode the resized photos waiting for upload
# (.minimalgallery/cache/media). The manifests (.minimalgallery/manifest)
# are committed, and in repo mode the resized photos (public/_mg) too: hosts
# build the site from them.
.minimalgallery/cache

# The original photos stay out of git: hosts build the site from the
# manifests and resized photos, never from the files in photos/, and a
# repository of originals outgrows GitHub’s limits (on GitHub Pages it is
# also public). The sidecars (.md, .json, .xmp) and each album’s _album.md
# are committed. To commit the originals too, delete these lines and set
# "minimalgallery": { "commitOriginals": true } in package.json.
photos/**
!photos/**/
!photos/**/*.md
!photos/**/*.json
!photos/**/*.xmp
!photos/**/*.XMP
